  "description": "Watercress is peppery, plump, and loaded with character. Here, we turn it into a full meal by pairing it with pan-roasted oyster mushrooms, Parmesan cheese, and a flavorful tarragon vinaigrette.",
  "notes": "Optional substitutions: Vegetable oil → canola oil; Parmigiano-Reggiano Padano cheese → Grana Padano cheese\n\nNotes: If you can't find oyster mushrooms, feel free to substitute others, such as king oyster or cremini (sliced and then seared), or hen-of-the-woods (divided by hand into small clusters).",
